@startuml
title DataX 数据源检查的五个层次

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #334155
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  FontColor #0F172A
}

rectangle "1. JDBC 建连\n地址、端口、驱动、认证" as connect #E0F2FE
rectangle "2. Reader dryRun\nquerySql 解析、首条真实查询、splitPk 检查" as reader #DBEAFE
rectangle "3. Writer dryRun\npreSql / postSql 解析、零行 INSERT / DELETE" as writer #DBEAFE
rectangle "4. 受控样本\n真实字段值经过转换、批量写与提交" as sample #FEF3C7
rectangle "5. 生产运行\n长连接、峰值吞吐、锁、超时与网络设备" as production #DCFCE7

connect -down-> reader : 完整任务配置
reader -down-> writer
writer -down-> sample : 小范围、可回滚
sample -down-> production : 容量验证后发布

note right of connect
  “测试连接成功”
  通常只证明到这里
end note

note right of writer
  能挡住确定性配置错误
  不能证明整批数据可写
end note
@enduml
